    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Bypass Cover.</strong> Your ranged attacks with weapons ignore Half Cover and Three-Quarters Cover.</p><p><strong>Firing in Melee.</strong> Being within 5 feet of an enemy doesn’t impose Disadvantage on your attack rolls with Ranged weapons.</p><p><strong>Long Shots.</strong> Attacking at long range doesn’t impose Disadvantage on your attack rolls with Ranged weapons.</p>",
